  ('p-lava-ritual-bundle', 'The Lava Ritual Bundle', 'Lava', 'intimate-care', 'physical', 'A set of three Lava products: a full-size 4 oz bottle of Lava Lube (silicone-based, no preservatives, dyes or fragrance), Lava To-Go (seven 2 mL travel sachets of the same lube) and Hanky by Lava, a 17 x 30 inch water-resistant intimacy towel to lay down during sex to protect the sheets and for cleanup afterward. Bought separately on mylavalube.com the three cost $65.97 ($29.99, $16.99 and $18.99); the bundle is $55.', '$55 (4 oz Lava Lube + Lava To-Go 7 x 2 mL sachets + Hanky by Lava towel), per mylavalube.com', '/products/lava/lava-ritual-bundle.webp', 'https://mylavalube.com/products/the-lava-ritual-bundle', '["comfort","discomfort","fragrance-free","hormone-free"]'::jsonb, '["sexual-health"]'::jsonb, '["mylavalube.com"]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, '{"fdaStatus":"Lava says its personal lubricant is \"FDA 510(k) cleared as a Class II medical device.\" ayna searched the FDA''s 510(k) and registration databases on November 23, 2026 and found no clearance under the Lava name, so this is per Lava until a K-number is confirmed. The towel is not a medical device.","materials":"Lava Lube 4 fl oz bottle and 7 x 2 mL Lava To-Go sachets. Lube ingredients, per mylavalube.com: cyclopentasiloxane, dimethicone, dimethiconol. Hanky by Lava: water-resistant intimacy towel, 17 x 30 inches (fabric not listed on mylavalube.com).","recalls":"No recalls are mentioned on mylavalube.com; check current FDA recall notices.","sideEffects":"Lava''s product pages list no side effects. Stop using the lube if you notice irritation.","opinionAlerts":"Silicone lubricants can damage silicone toys: Lava says to avoid using the lube with silicone toys. Trying to conceive? Lava recommends external use only and suggests asking your doctor."}'::jsonb, 'Lava describes the bundle as its signature lubricant, travel-ready sachets and the Hanky towel together, "to create a complete, effortless ritual at home or away." Lava was founded by pelvic health physical therapist Kristen Damery.

The lube is the same silicone-based formula sold on its own as Lava Lube; Lava says it lasts longer than water-based lubes, isn''t sticky and is condom compatible. The Lava Lube card has Lava''s reason for each ingredient and the independent research on silicone lubricants in general. No study of Lava itself is published on its site.', 'mylavalube.com shows no reviews on the bundle page itself (checked November 23, 2026). The lube in it has 5.0 out of 5 from 14 reviews on the Lava Lube page.', 'A bundle of Lava''s lube, travel sachets and towel. No study of Lava itself is published on its site.', 'brand', 'Sourced only from Lava''s own site (mylavalube.com). See the Lava Lube card for independent research on silicone lubricants.', 'curated', false, false, null, true, '{"affiliateUrl":"https://mylavalube.com/?ref=AYNA10","doctorOpinionShort":"Lava Lube, Lava To-Go sachets and a water-resistant intimacy towel in one set, $10.97 less than buying them separately. No study of Lava itself is published.","doctorOpinionCitations":[{"url":"https://mylavalube.com/products/the-lava-ritual-bundle","label":"mylavalube.com: The Lava Ritual Bundle"}],"whoItsFor":["Anyone who wants lube for home and for travel in one purchase","A gift set","Protecting sheets during sex and easy cleanup, with the towel"],"howToUse":{"intro":"Per Lava''s directions:","steps":["Lube: apply a few drops to the area you want to lubricate, and add more as needed. Washes off with soap and water.","To-Go sachets: one pre-measured 2 mL sachet per use, for travel or your bag.","Hanky: lay the towel under you during intimacy to protect the sheets, and use it for cleanup afterward.","Store the lube upright in a cool, dry place."],"sourceUrl":"https://mylavalube.com/products/the-lava-ritual-bundle","sourceLabel":"mylavalube.com: The Lava Ritual Bundle"},"warnings":["Avoid using the lube with silicone toys: Lava says it will degrade the silicone.","Trying to conceive? Lava recommends using the lube externally only and checking with your doctor.","Stop using the lube if irritation, burning or itching develops, and see a clinician if it continues."],"ingredients":"Lube: cyclopentasiloxane, dimethicone, dimethiconol (silicone-based). No preservatives, dyes or fragrance.","ingredientScienceNote":"The lube''s ingredients, with Lava''s own explanation of why each is there (from the \"Ingredients, in plain english\" section on mylavalube.com). Lava''s explanations are the brand''s descriptions, not checked by ayna.","ingredientScience":[{"name":"Cyclopentasiloxane","text":"Per Lava: gives Lava its lightweight, silky feel and helps it spread easily.","citations":[{"url":"https://mylavalube.com/products/personal-lubricant","label":"mylavalube.com: Ingredients, in plain english (Lava Lube page)"}]},{"name":"Dimethicone","text":"Per Lava: gives Lava the long-lasting glide.","citations":[{"url":"https://mylavalube.com/products/personal-lubricant","label":"mylavalube.com: Ingredients, in plain english (Lava Lube page)"}]},{"name":"Dimethiconol","text":"Per Lava: helps Lava feel smooth and stay put.","citations":[{"url":"https://mylavalube.com/products/personal-lubricant","label":"mylavalube.com: Ingredients, in plain english (Lava Lube page)"}]}],"scientificCitations":[],"verificationLinks":{"doctor":{"links":[]},"scientific":{"links":[]},"community":{"links":[{"platform":"website","url":"https://mylavalube.com/products/the-lava-ritual-bundle","text":"mylavalube.com: The Lava Ritual Bundle","summary":"Lava''s bundle page, with what''s inside."},{"platform":"website","url":"https://mylavalube.com/products/hanky-by-lava","text":"mylavalube.com: Hanky by Lava","summary":"The towel on its own ($18.99): 17 x 30 inches, water resistant."},{"platform":"website","url":"https://mylavalube.com/products/personal-lubricant","text":"mylavalube.com: Lava Lube reviews","summary":"5.0 out of 5 from 14 reviews as of November 23, 2026."}]}},"integrations":[],"badges":[],"isEmergingBrand":true}'::jsonb)
